#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkRockRidge)
#: projects/base_k3badvanceddataimagesettings.ui:233
msgid "Add Rock Ridge extensions to the file system"
msgstr "Dodaj Rock Ridge dodatke u datotečni sistem"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkRockRidge)
#: projects/base_k3badvanceddataimagesettings.ui:239
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is checked, K3b will generate the System Use Sharing "
"Protocol records (SUSP) specified by the Rock Ridge Interchange Protocol "
"(IEEE-P1282).\n"
"<p>Rock Ridge extends the ISO-9660 filesystem by features equal to the UNIX "
"filesystems (permissions, symbolic links, very long filenames, ...). It uses "
"ISO-8859 or UTF-16 based characters and allows 255 octets.\n"
"<p>Rock Ridge extensions are located at the end of each ISO-9660 directory "
"record. This makes the Rock Ridge tree closely coupled to the ISO-9660 "
"tree.\n"
"<p><b>It is highly recommended to use Rock Ridge extensions on every data CD "
"or DVD.</b>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Ako je ova opcija čekirana, K3b će generirati Sistem Koristi Djelene "
"Protokole zabilješke (SUSP) specifirane od Rock Ridge Prokola za Razmjenu "
"(IEEE-P1282).\n"
"<p>Rock Ridge proširuje  ISO-966 datotečni sistem osobinama jednakim UNIX "
"datotečnim sistemima (dozvole, simbolične linkove, veoma duge nazive "
"datoteka, ...). On koristi ISO-8859 ili UTF-16 bazirane karaktere i "
"dozvoljava 255 oktete. \n"
"<p>Rock Ridge dodatci su lociranu na kraju svakog ISO-9660 direktorijskog "
"upisa. Ovo znači da Rock Ridge stablo je usko povezano sa ISO-9660 stablom.\n"
"<p><b>Veoma je preporučljivo da koristite Rock Ridge dodatke na svakom CD "
"ili DVD sa podatcima.</b>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkRockRidge)
#: projects/base_k3badvanceddataimagesettings.ui:242
msgid "&Generate Rock Ridge extensions"
msgstr "Napravi &Rock Ridge proširenja"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkJoliet)
#: projects/base_k3badvanceddataimagesettings.ui:252
msgid "Add Joliet extensions to the file system"
msgstr "Dodaj Joliet dodatke u datotečni sistem"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkJoliet)
#: projects/base_k3badvanceddataimagesettings.ui:259
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is checked, K3b will add additional Joliet extensions to "
"the ISO-9660 file system.\n"
"<p>Joliet is not an accepted independent international standard like "
"ISO-9660 or Rock Ridge. It is mainly used on Windows systems.\n"
"<p>Joliet does not allow all characters, so the Joliet filenames are not "
"identical to the filenames on disk (as compared to Rock Ridge). Joliet has a "
"filename length limitation of 64 chars (independent from the character "
"coding and type e.g. European vs. Japanese). This is inconvenient, as modern "
"file systems all allow 255 characters per path name component.\n"
"<p>Joliet uses UTF-16 coding.\n"
"<p><b>Caution:</b> With the exception of Linux and FreeBSD, there is no "
"POSIX-like OS that supports Joliet. So <b>never create Joliet-only CDs or "
"DVDs</b> for that reason."
msgstr ""
"<p>Ako je ovo popunjeno, K3b će staviti dodatna džolijet proširenja u "
"ISO‑9660 datotečni sistem.</p><p>Džolijet nije prihvaćeni nezavisni "
"međunarodni standard poput ISO‑a 9660 ili rokridža. Najčešće se koristi na "
"vindouz sistemima.</p><p>Džolijet ne dozvoljava sve znakove, tako da "
"džolijet imena datoteka nisu identična imenima na disku (u poređenju sa "
"rokridžom). Džolijet ima ograničenje imena datoteke na 64 znaka (nezavisno "
"od vrste i kodiranja znakova npr. evropski pr. japanski). To je nezgodno jer "
"svi novi datotečni sistemi dozvoljavaju 255 znakova za ime datoteke ili "
"direktorije.</p><p>Džolijet koristi UTF‑16 kodiranje.</p><p><b>Pažnja:</b> "
"Sa izuzetkom Linuksa i FriBSD‑a, ne postoji POSIKS-oliki operativni sistem "
"koji podržava džolijet. Zato <b>nikada ne pravite čisti džolijet CD ili DVD</"
"b>.</p>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkJoliet)
#: projects/base_k3badvanceddataimagesettings.ui:262
msgid "Generate &Joliet extensions"
msgstr "Napravi &Joliet proširenja"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkUdf)
#: projects/base_k3badvanceddataimagesettings.ui:269
msgid "Add UDF structures to the file system"
msgstr "Dodaj UDF strukture u datotečni sistem"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkUdf)
#: projects/base_k3badvanceddataimagesettings.ui:273
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is checked K3b will create UDF filesystem structures in "
"addition to the ISO9660 filesystem.\n"
"<p>The UDF (<em><b>U</b>niversal <b>D</b>isk <b>F</b>ormat</em>) is mainly "
"used for DVDs."
msgstr ""
"<p>Ako je ova opcija čekirana K3b će kreirati UDF datotečni sistemske "
"strukture kao dodatak ISO9660 datotečnom sistemu.\n"
"<p>UDF (<em><b>U</b>niversal <b>D</b>isk <b>F</b>ormat</em>) je uglavnom "
"korišten za DVD-ove."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkUdf)
#: projects/base_k3badvanceddataimagesettings.ui:276
msgid "Generate &UDF structures"
msgstr "Napravi &UDF strukture"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox_2)
#: projects/base_k3badvanceddataimagesettings.ui:286
msgid "Other Settings"
msgstr "Druga podešavanja"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkPreservePermissions)
#: projects/base_k3badvanceddataimagesettings.ui:293
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is checked, all files in the resulting file system will "
"have exactly the same permissions as the source files. (Otherwise, all files "
"will have equal permissions and be owned by root).\n"
"<p>This is mainly useful for backups.<p><b>Caution:</b> The permissions may "
"not make much sense on other file systems; for example, if a user that owns "
"a file on the CD or DVD does not exist."
msgstr ""
"<p>Ako je ova opcija čekirana, svi podatci u rezultirajućem sistemu će imati "
"potupno iste dozvole kao i izvorne podatci. (U drugom slučaju, svi podatci "
"će imati jednake dozvole i će posjedovati root).\n"
"<p>Ovo je uglavnom korisno za backup-e.<p><b>Upozorenje:</b> Dozvole nekad "
"ne prave mnogo smisla drugim sistemima, kao primjer, ako korisnik koji "
"posjeduje datoteku na CD ili DVD neće postojati."

