#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkPlaylistRelative)
#: rip/base_k3baudiorippingoptionwidget.ui:95
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is checked, the entries in the playlist will be relative "
"to its location.\n"
"<p>Example: If your playlist is located in <em>/home/myself/music</em> and\n"
"your audio files are in <em>/home/myself/music/cool</em>; then the entries "
"in the\n"
"playlist will look something like: <em>cool/track1.ogg</em>."
msgstr ""
"<p>Ako je ova opcija čekirana, upisi u pleyliste će biti relativni na "
"njihovu lokaciju.\n"
"<p>Primjer: Ako je plejlista locirana u <em>/home/ja/muzika</em> i \n"
"vaši audio podatci su u <em>/home/ja/muzika/cool</em>; onda će upisi u \n"
"plejlisti izgledati poput:<em>cool/traka1.ogg</em>."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkPlaylistRelative)
#: rip/base_k3baudiorippingoptionwidget.ui:98
